# The repository stores the majority of its text files with CRLF line
# endings and core.autocrlf is disabled, so `git diff --check` would
# otherwise report the CR of every added line as trailing whitespace.
# cr-at-eol makes the check CR-tolerant while blank-at-eol keeps catching
# real trailing spaces and tabs.
* whitespace=blank-at-eol,cr-at-eol
